The '''Blood Fruit''' is a [[Fruit Treasures|Fruit Treasure]] found in [[Into the Future]]. It improves the effect of most [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]] [[Special Abilities|abilities]].

==Effect==
At 100% on all Blood Fruit Treasures, the following [[Special Abilities|abilities]] are enhanced when used against [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red Enemies]]:
