==Trivia==
*Despite being listed seventh in the [[Treasure]] menu, the Blood Fruit is actually the sixth obtainable Into the Future Treasure.
*The Blood Fruit originally only improved the Weaken effect's duration by 10% and the Knockback effect's distance by 20%. This was changed at an unknown date.
*The Blood Fruit, like other fruits is based on a real-life fruit, this being a pomegranate.

